## 2. `feature_device_settings` 包结构

### 文件布局

```
packages/feature/device/feature_device_settings/
├── lib/
│   ├── feature_device_settings.dart          # 导出
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── controller/device_settings_controller.dart
│   │   ├── model/device_settings_state.dart
│   │   ├── pages/device_settings_page.dart
│   │   └── routing/routes.dart
```

有 **controller + model + page**，没有独立 repository/service 层。

### BLE 发送模式

Controller 通过 `glassesCommandSenderProvider` 发命令，**不监听设备回执**（fire-and-forget + `Result` 判断写 GATT 是否成功）：

```30:68:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_settings/lib/src/controller/device_settings_controller.dart
  Future<Result<void>> setVolume(int volume) async {
    if (!ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected) {
      return const Result.failure(...);
    }
    final sendResult = await _sender.setVolume(volume);
    return sendResult.fold(
      onSuccess: (_) {
        state = state.copyWith(volume: volume, clearError: true);
        return const Result.success(null);
      },
      onFailure: (error) {
        state = state.copyWith(lastError: error.message);
        return Result.failure(error);
      },
    );
  }
```

`DeviceSettingsState` 目前只有 `volume`、`wifiScanEnabled`、`lastError`，**没有**视频长度、画幅方向、水印、自动保存字段。

### 页面现状

`DeviceSettingsPage` 是蓝湖对齐的卡片列表 UI，**"多媒体设置"入口已占位但 `onTap: showSoon`**，其余项也大多是 coming soon：

```38:44:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_settings/lib/src/pages/device_settings_page.dart
              _SettingsItem(
                key: const Key('settings-multimedia'),
                title: l10n.multimediaSettings,
                asset: 'assets/images/settings/icon_multimedia@2x.png',
                onTap: showSoon,
              ),
```

l10n 已有 `multimediaSettings`（中/英），图标 `icon_multimedia@2x.png` 也在包里。

**结论：** 该包是 WiFi/音量 controller 的薄壳 + 系统设置 UI 骨架；多媒体相关逻辑需新建页面/controller，或扩到 `feature_device_album`。

