## 3. 按 deviceId 持久化设置的 Repository 模式

仓库里有多套可复用模式，按场景推荐：

### 最接近「按 deviceId 存一组设置」：`DeviceAlbumHiddenStore`

键名带 deviceId 后缀，用 `core_storage` JSON：

```13:38:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/service/device_album_hidden_store.dart
  String _key(String deviceId) => 'device_album.hidden.$deviceId';

  Future<Set<String>> load(String deviceId) async {
    final text = _storage.getString(_key(deviceId));
    // ...
  }

  Future<void> hideMany(String deviceId, Set<String> mediaIds) async {
    final hidden = await load(deviceId);
    hidden.addAll(mediaIds);
    await _storage.setString(_key(deviceId), jsonEncode(hidden.toList()));
  }
```

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/service/device_album_hidden_store.dart`

### 全局 JSON 列表 + 按 deviceId 过滤：`DeviceScheduleRepository`

```17:25:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_schedule/lib/src/service/device_schedule_repository.dart
  Future<List<DeviceScheduleRecord>> load(String deviceId) async {
    final all = _loadAll();
    final records = [
      for (final record in all)
        if (record.deviceId == deviceId) record,
    ]..sort((a, b) => a.startAt.compareTo(b.startAt));
    return records;
  }
```

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_schedule/lib/src/service/device_schedule_repository.dart`

### `CallRecordHistoryRepository`（你提到的例子）

全局单 key，**不按 deviceId 分桶**，更适合通话录音历史而非设备设置：

```13:33:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_record/lib/src/service/call_record_history_repository.dart
  static const _key = 'call_record_history_entries';

  List<CallRecordEntry> load() {
    final raw = _storage.getString(_key);
    // jsonDecode → List<CallRecordEntry>
  }
```

**建议：** 多媒体设置（水印、自动保存等纯 App 侧偏好）用 `DeviceAlbumHiddenStore` 的 `device_album.settings.$deviceId` 键模式最省事；若还要存 BLE 下发的当前值，可建 `MultimediaSettingsRepository` 仿照其结构。

