## 4. `feature_device_album` 导入完成钩子（自动保存到系统相册）

### 钩子点 1：`DeviceAlbumController._handleImportEvent`

每个文件下载完成时，`DeviceMediaImportStatus.fileCompleted` 分支会更新列表，**目前没有额外副作用**，是接「自动保存」的自然扩展点：

```212:231:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/controller/device_album_controller.dart
      case DeviceMediaImportStatus.fileCompleted:
        final item = event.item;
        final items =
            item == null
                  ? state.items
                  : [
                      item,
                      ...state.items.where(
                        (candidate) => candidate.id != item.id,
                      ),
                    ]
              ..sort((a, b) => b.createdAt.compareTo(a.createdAt));
        state = state.copyWith(
          syncing: true,
          taskId: nextTaskId,
          items: items,
          // ...
        );
```

同类模式在 `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_record/lib/src/controller/device_record_download_controller.dart` 的 `fileCompleted` 分支。

### 钩子点 2：`DeviceMediaTransferTarget.saveToSystemAlbum`

字段已预留，从 `DeviceAlbumConfig` 传入：

```301:311:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/controller/device_album_controller.dart
    return DeviceMediaTransferTarget(
      deviceId: deviceId,
      userId: _config.userId,
      saveToSystemAlbum: _config.saveToSystemAlbum,
    );
```

```4:18:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_album/lib/src/model/device_album_config.dart
  const DeviceAlbumConfig({
    this.userId = 'default',
    this.saveToSystemAlbum = false,
    this.minBatteryForImport = 20,
  });
  final bool saveToSystemAlbum;
```

### 但底层尚未实现

`BkFtpDeviceMediaTransferClient` 下载后只写到 App sandbox（`device_album/` 目录），**未读取 `saveToSystemAlbum`**，也未调用系统相册 API：

```419:427:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_device_file_transfer/lib/src/service/bk_ftp_device_media_transfer_client.dart
      final localFile = File(p.join(localDirectory.path, remote.name));
      // ...
      await tempFile.rename(localFile.path);
      if (config.deleteRemoteAfterImport) {
        await ftp.deleteFile(remote.name);
      }
      return localFile;
```

`fileCompleted` 事件在 FTP client 里 yield：

```182:189:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_device_file_transfer/lib/src/service/bk_ftp_device_media_transfer_client.dart
        yield DeviceMediaImportEvent(
          status: DeviceMediaImportStatus.fileCompleted,
          taskId: taskId,
          item: item,
          index: index,
          total: total,
          progress: index / total,
        );
```

**结论：** 钩子有两层可选——在 Controller 的 `fileCompleted` 做 App 侧保存，或在 `BkFtpDeviceMediaTransferClient._downloadRemoteFile` 下载完成后根据 `target.saveToSystemAlbum` 写相册。目前全是占位，默认 `saveToSystemAlbum: false`（见 `apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart`）。

